    "why_not_L4": "The accepted denominator still consists of two singled-out raw chambers.  The positive-dimensional automatic boundary-skeleton families do not return the finite-volume polytopes: their skeleton cones have hyperideal rays, and generic members have hidden/additional negative curves.  No independently defined non-singleton raw-P class is yet proved automatically to acquire all extra walls and no hidden walls."
